# Template for local dev with clinical-panel + clinical-panel-bff + core (all local).
#
# Copy to .env.dev-local in the clinical-panel repo:
#   cp .env.dev-local.example .env.dev-local
#
# Then run:
#   yarn start:local
#
# This runs `vite --mode dev-local`, which loads .env.dev-local instead of
# .env.development. No file swapping needed — `yarn start` for GCP, `yarn start:local` for local.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   make clinical-up   (in product-engineer-agent repo — starts core:3000 + bff:4050 + panel:5050)

